Protocol Goedel.Protocol.Test TestSchema TestSchema

	Description
		|Classes to be used to test serialization an deserialization.



	Structure StoreUpdate
		String SomeString
		Struct Enveloped AnEnvelope
			Description
				|The entries to be uploaded. 
		Struct Enveloped Envelopes
			Multiple
			Description
				|The entries to be uploaded. 


	Structure TestEnveloped
		Description
			|Base for generic envelope
		String		Header
		String		Body
		String		Trailer


	Structure MultiInstance
		GStruct TestEnveloped MultiInstance Generic
		Description
			|Contains one instance of each type of field.
		String		Type
			TypeTag
		Boolean		FieldBoolean
		Integer		FieldInteger
		Float		FieldFloat
		DateTime	FieldDateTime
		String		FieldString
		Binary		FieldBinary
	


	Structure MultiArray
		Inherits MultiInstance
		Boolean		ArrayBoolean
			Multiple
		Integer		ArrayInteger
			Multiple
		Float		ArrayFloat
			Multiple 
		DateTime	ArrayDateTime
			Multiple
		String		ArrayString
			Multiple
		Binary		ArrayBinary
			Multiple

	Structure DictArray
		Inherits MultiArray
		Boolean		DictBoolean
			Dictionary
		Integer		DictInteger
			Dictionary
		Float		DictFloat
			Dictionary 
		DateTime	DictDateTime
			Dictionary
		String		DictString
			Dictionary
		Binary		DictBinary
			Dictionary


	Structure MultiStruct
		Inherits MultiArray

		Struct MultiInstance		FieldMultiInstance
		Struct MultiInstance		ArrayMultiInstance
			Multiple

		TStruct MultiInstance		TFieldMultiInstance
		TStruct MultiInstance		TArrayMultiInstance
			Multiple
